# Node.js Rules (Express/NestJS + TypeScript)

## 🏗️ Structure
```
backend/{service}/
├── src/
│   ├── controllers/
│   ├── services/
│   ├── models/
│   ├── routes/
│   ├── middleware/
│   └── config/
├── tests/
└── {service}.ts
```

## 📐 Naming
- Class: PascalCase + suffix (Controller/Service/Model)
- Method/Variable: camelCase
- Constant: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
- File: kebab-case hoặc dot.notation
- DTO: PascalCase + Dto

## ✅ MUST
- Use class-validator cho DTO validation
- Async/await (NO callback hell)
- Use RabbitMQ client cho message queue
- Use TypeORM hoặc Prisma cho DB
- Use Jest cho test
- Use proper logging (winston/pino)

## ❌ NEVER
- `any` type (dùng `unknown` + type guards)
- `console.log` (dùng Logger)
- Magic numbers
- Hardcoded secrets, URLs
- var (chỉ const/let)
- Empty catch block
- Business logic trong Controller

## 🧪 Test
- Jest + Supertest
- Test files: `*.test.ts` hoặc `*.spec.ts`
- Mock với `jest.Mocked<T>`
- Coverage ≥ 80%
